<& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"<i>Petunia inflata</i> 草圖基因組序列 v1.0.1(<i>Petunia inflata</i> draft genome sequence v1.0.1)" &>

<p>
  <i>Petunia inflata</i>（Petunia hybrida 的祖先之一）的草圖基因組序列已公開發布（Bombarely 等人，2016）。<i>P. inflata S6</i> 基因組定序是採用短讀段從頭組裝完成的（Illumina；深度 135X）。(A draft sequence of the <i>Petunia inflata</i> genome, one of the ancestors of Petunia hybrida, is publicly available (Bombarely et al, 2016).
  The <i>P. inflata S6</i> genome sequence, was performed using a short read de novo assembly (Illumina; coverage 135X))<br>
</p>


<p>
  <i>Petunia inflata</i> 基因組數據可透過 BLAST、JBrowse 和 SGN VIGS 工具在 SGN 上存取，並可從 SGN FTP 網站下載。(The <i>Petunia inflata</i> genome data are accessible on SGN through BLAST, JBrowse and the SGN VIGS Tool, and they can be downloaded from the SGN ftp site.)
</p>

<br>

